	<section_number>4.1-348</section_number>
	<catch_line>Beverages not licensed under this subtitle</catch_line>
	<text>
		The provisions of §§ 4.1-339 through 4.1-348 shall not apply to alcoholic beverages which may be manufactured and sold without any license under the provisions of this subtitle.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 4-56; 1954, c. 504; 1968, c. 763; 1971, Ex. Sess., c. 155; 1973, c. 16; 1978, cc. 434, 436; 1981, c. 365; 1983, c. 271; 1984, c. 52; 1993, c. 866.</history>
